# Claude Code local state. `worktrees/` holds throwaway agent worktrees, and
# settings.json and settings.local.json here are machine-specific (absolute
# hook paths, per-machine permissions), so none of them is shareable.
# Drop these lines if you ever want to commit project-wide settings.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
